--------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Chinese poem English translations
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source: chinese-poems.com
Compiled via: https://github.com/BoogeeDoo/chinese-poetries-english-translation-json
Used in: public/datafile/poetry/*.json (entries whose translationSource
         starts with "chinese-poems.com/")
Coverage: 64 poems

The translations were compiled from the public chinese-poems.com website.
The original pages do not name individual translators. The upstream JSON
repository is MIT-licensed, but that license covers the repository
compilation only; it does not grant rights to the underlying translations.
This project therefore does not re-license these translations.

If you are a rights holder and want a translation removed, please open an
issue in this repository. Entries can be removed by deleting the affected
poems' `translation` and `translationSource` fields in
public/datafile/poetry/*.json.

